the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    *a person* qualifies under s3_1_a.
    *a person* is a person; scenario element.
    *a person* was a pensioner on July 1 1977; scenario element.
    *a person* meets the residence requirements of section 3_1_b_i.
    *a person* was born on *a time*; scenario element.
    as of July 1977 *a person* resided in Canada; scenario element.
    as of July 1977 *a person* possessed a valid immigration visa; scenario element.
    as of July 1977 *a person* had resided in Canada after 18 years of age; scenario element.
    *a person* meets the age requirement of section 3_1_b_ii.
    the date today is *a time*.
    *a person* qualifies under s3_1_b.
    *a person* meets the residence duration requirement of section 3_1_b_iii.
    *a person* qualifies under s3_1_c.
    *a person* satisfies the non pensioner requirement of s3_1_c_i.
    *a person* satisfies the age requirement of s3_1_c_ii.
    *a person* satisfies the residency requirement of s3_1_c_iii.
    a full monthly pension may be paid to *a person*; opposite: a full monthly pension may not be paid to *a person*.
    *a person* resided in canada for 10 years prior to approval; scenario element.
    *a person* was in Canada more than away between 18 and 10 years prior to approval; scenario element.
    *a person* resided in Canada for the year prior to approval; scenario element.
    *a person* resided in Canada at least 40 years since the age of 18; scenario element.
    *a person* satisfies section 4_1_a.
    *a person* satisfies section 4_1_b.
    *a person* was a citizen or legal resident the day before approval; scenario element.
    *a person* meets the residence requirements of section 3_1_b_i under *a provision*.
    *a person* meets the age requirement of section 3_1_b_ii under *a provision*.
    *a person* meets the residence duration requirement of section 3_1_b_iii under *a provision*.
    *a person* satisfies the non pensioner requirement of s3_1_c_i under *a provision*.
    *a person* satisfies the age requirement of s3_1_c_ii under *a provision*.
    *a person* satisfies the residency requirement of s3_1_c_iii under *a provision*.
    *a person* qualifies under s3_1_a under *a provision*.
    *a person* qualifies under s3_1_b under *a provision*.
    *a person* qualifies under s3_1_c under *a provision*.
    a full monthly pension may not be paid to *a person* under *a provision*.
    *a person* satisfies section 4_1_a under *a provision*.
    *a person* satisfies section 4_1_b under *a provision*.

