% Blawx's clock, fixed at 2026-09-14 (00:00 UTC, 1789344000 seconds since 1970), the day the twin was built.
the date today is 1789344000.

% The Act, section by section.
rule section_3_1_a with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 a:
a person qualifies under s3_1_a under section_3_1_a if
    the person is a person
    and the person was a pensioner on July 1 1977.

% What section 3(1)(a) concludes holds.
rule section_3_1_a_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 a:
a person qualifies under s3_1_a if
    the person qualifies under s3_1_a under section_3_1_a.

