rule section_3_1_b with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 b:
a person qualifies under s3_1_b under section_3_1_b if
    the person is a person
    and the person meets the residence requirements of section 3 _ 1 _ b_i under section_3_1_b_i
    and the person meets the age requirement of section 3 _ 1 _ b_ii under section_3_1_b_ii
    and the person meets the residence duration requirement of section 3 _ 1 _ b_iii under section_3_1_b_iii.

% What section 3(1)(b) concludes holds.
rule section_3_1_b_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 b:
a person qualifies under s3_1_b if
    the person qualifies under s3_1_b under section_3_1_b.

rule section_3_1_c with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 c:
a person qualifies under s3_1_c under section_3_1_c if
    the person is a person
    and the person satisfies the non pensioner requirement of s3_1_c_i under section_3_1_c_i
    and the person satisfies the age requirement of s3_1_c_ii under section_3_1_c_ii
    and the person satisfies the residency requirement of s3_1_c_iii under section_3_1_c_iii.

% What section 3(1)(c) concludes holds.
rule section_3_1_c_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 c:
a person qualifies under s3_1_c if
    the person qualifies under s3_1_c under section_3_1_c.

rule section_3_1 with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1:
a full monthly pension may be paid to a person if
    the person qualifies under s3_1_a under section_3_1_a
    and it is not the case that a full monthly pension may not be paid to the person under section_4_1.

rule section_3_1_2 with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1:
a full monthly pension may be paid to a person if
    the person qualifies under s3_1_b under section_3_1_b
    and it is not the case that a full monthly pension may not be paid to the person under section_4_1.

rule section_3_1_3 with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1:
a full monthly pension may be paid to a person if
    the person qualifies under s3_1_c under section_3_1_c
    and it is not the case that a full monthly pension may not be paid to the person under section_4_1.

rule section_3_1_b_iii with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 b iii:
a person meets the residence duration requirement of section 3 _ 1 _ b_iii under section_3_1_b_iii if
    the person resided in canada for 10 years prior to approval.

% What section 3(1)(b)(iii) concludes holds.
rule section_3_1_b_iii_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 b iii:
a person meets the residence duration requirement of section 3 _ 1 _ b_iii if
    the person meets the residence duration requirement of section 3 _ 1 _ b_iii under section_3_1_b_iii.

rule section_3_1_b_iii_2 with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 b iii:
a person meets the residence duration requirement of section 3 _ 1 _ b_iii under section_3_1_b_iii if
    it is not the case that the person resided in canada for 10 years prior to approval
    and the person was in Canada more than away between 18 and 10 years prior to approval
    and the person resided in Canada for the year prior to approval.

