rule section_3_1_c_i with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 c i:
a person satisfies the non pensioner requirement of s3_1_c_i under section_3_1_c_i if
    it is not the case that the person was a pensioner on July 1 1977.

% What section 3(1)(c)(i) concludes holds.
rule section_3_1_c_i_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 c i:
a person satisfies the non pensioner requirement of s3_1_c_i if
    the person satisfies the non pensioner requirement of s3_1_c_i under section_3_1_c_i.

rule section_3_1_c_iii with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 c iii:
a person satisfies the residency requirement of s3_1_c_iii under section_3_1_c_iii if
    the person resided in Canada at least 40 years since the age of 18.

% What section 3(1)(c)(iii) concludes holds.
rule section_3_1_c_iii_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 3 1 c iii:
a person satisfies the residency requirement of s3_1_c_iii if
    the person satisfies the residency requirement of s3_1_c_iii under section_3_1_c_iii.

% "Eligible" and "full monthly pension may be paid to" have been
% combined into a single statement. Therefore, this section
% says that if your are not a pensioner, and neither a
% nor b is true, a full monthly pension may not be paid.
rule section_4_1 with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 4 1:
a full monthly pension may not be paid to a person under section_4_1 if
    the person is a person
    and it is not the case that the person was a pensioner on July 1 1977
    and it is not the case that the person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ a under section_4_1_a
    and it is not the case that the person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ b under section_4_1_b.

% What section 4(1) concludes holds.
rule section_4_1_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 4 1:
a full monthly pension may not be paid to a person if
    a full monthly pension may not be paid to the person under section_4_1.

rule section_4_1_a with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 4 1 a:
a person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ a under section_4_1_a if
    the person was a citizen or legal resident the day before approval.

% What section 4(1)(a) concludes holds.
rule section_4_1_a_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 4 1 a:
a person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ a if
    the person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ a under section_4_1_a.

rule section_4_1_b with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 4 1 b:
a person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ b under section_4_1_b if
    the person was a citizen or legal resident the day before approval.

% What section 4(1)(b) concludes holds.
rule section_4_1_b_conclusion with provenance the Old Age Security Act at section 4 1 b:
a person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ b if
    the person satisfies section 4 _ 1 _ b under section_4_1_b.

